# The build context of live/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads this file for that Dockerfile only): the
# pins and the code that the two services import. The campaigns (eval/results), the day cache
# (eval/cache), data/, the console's node_modules and the numba caches in __pycache__ stay out.
*
!correlation/requirements.txt
!live/*.py
!eval/*.py
!twin/*.py
!plant/model/
!plant/floor/
**/__pycache__
plant/model/*.md
